Q	how many pairs of chromosomes do humans have
N	6
R	genome.gov	Chromosomes Fact Sheet	How many chromosomes do humans have? Humans have 23 pairs of chromosomes, for a total of 46 chromosomes. In fact, each species of plants and animals has a set number of chromosomes.	https://www.genome.gov/about-genomics/fact-sheets/Chromosomes-Fact-Sheet	154dee831e4d83baf27cf62466987e7b283f6a364ae5e252cdf00d0e9ca6dbce	230393
